+the exact degraded-intake condition and never claim the intake ran. Read only the
+host-named local entry documents as fallback evidence, and continue only when they
+establish the project boundary, authority constraints, and safe routing needed for
+the task. If the host instruction makes the provider a hard stop and supplies no
+fallback, stop and ask the human rather than inventing intake results.
